  "body": " Watching the Gap Grow   Ksh is saved for years at per annum. Use or a calculator.     Find the amount after years with simple interest and with compound interest.    Find the gap between the two amounts after , , and years.    Why is there no gap after one year?    Move the rate slider to . Does compound interest still pull ahead?      "
