  "title": "A Teacher’s Payslip.",
  "body": " A Teacher's Payslip   Ms Jeptoo teaches in Eldoret. Her monthly basic pay is Ksh and her allowances are Ksh . Use .     Find her gross pay.    Her pension contribution of Ksh is taken off before tax. Find her taxable pay.    Find her PAYE.    The other deductions on her payslip total Ksh . Find her net pay.    Digital: open the PAYE page of the Kenya Revenue Authority website. Are the bands and relief the same as in ? Write down the date you checked.      "
