  "body": " Juma drew a cumulative frequency curve for the goat masses in , but he plotted the cumulative frequencies at . What did he do wrong, and how does it affect a median read from his graph?  He plotted at the class midpoints. His curve is half a class ( ) too far left, so his median is about too small.  are the midpoints of the classes, not the upper class boundaries . Every point is to the left of where it should be, so any value read across from the cumulative frequency axis, including the median, comes out about too small.  "
